oft and its family of companies via email and phone about Microsoft Learn and other Microsoft products and services. To withdraw consent or manage your contact preferences, visit the <a href="https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=243189">Promotional Communications Manager.</a> <a href="https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=521839">Privacy Statement.</a>',$q="I would like information, tips, and offers about Microsoft Learn and other Microsoft products and services.",zq='I would like information, tips, and offers about Microsoft Learn and other Microsoft products and services. <a href="https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=521839">Privacy Statement.</a>',Bq='Participation requires transferring your personal data to other countries in which Microsoft operates, including the United States. By submitting this form, you agree to the transfer of your data outside of China. <a href="https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=521839">Privacy Statement.</a>',BS="I agree to receiving marketing information and use of my personal information for marketing purposes (required):",Yq='<div class="content"><ul><li><span class="font-weight-bold font-size-lg">Consent to Receive Marketing</span>: The information collected may be used for Microsoft to send you information, tips, and offers about Microsoft Learn and other Microsoft products and services. </li><li> Items of Personal Information to be Collected: First Name, Last Name, Email Address, Phone Number, Company name and size, Job Title, Country/Region of residence, and any other fields visible on this form. </li><li>Purpose of Collection and Use: <span class="font-weight-bold font-size-lg">To contact you for marketing purposes </span></li><li> Retention/Use Period of Personal Information: <span class="font-weight-bold font-size-lg">As long as needed to provide the service(s) you are requesting </span></li></ul></div> You have the right to refuse the collection and use of personal information for marketing purposes, and receiving marketing information as set forth above. However, if you refuse, you may not be able to receive the benefits described under Purpose of Collection & Use. <a href="https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=521839">Privacy Statement.</a>';var id="Select a country/region";var Vq="Optional";var Sf="Other";var Gq="Overall, how satisfied or dissatisfied are you with Microsoft Learn?";var Sb="Page {pageNumber} of {numberOfPages}";var Qq="pagination";var Wq="Please fill out this field.",jq="Please provide an email address.";var Eb="Preview";var sd="Previous";var Kq="Profile";var Jq="Cloud Skills Challenge";var Xq="MSDN Forum",Zq="Questions that may already have your answer";var eU="answered",Ab="asked";var tU="{action} {time}",oU="Affiliations";var nU="Maximum number of attachments exceeded. Please select up to {maximumCount} attachments.";var Cb="Delete all user content",rU="Are you sure you want to delete all user content? This action cannot be undone.",aU="Deleted all user content successfully!",YS="Discard draft",kb="Discard saved draft",iU='Microsoft-affiliated users can no longer post questions to Microsoft Learn Q&A. Please use internal Microsoft support resources for assistance. <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/help/platform/contribute-qna-guidance">Learn more.</a>';var sU='Your post contains content that matches a protected Microsoft-sensitive pattern. Please remove any Microsoft internal, confidential, or restricted information before posting to this public forum. <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/help/platform/contribute-qna-guidance">Learn more.</a>';var cU="{displayName} {action} {time}",lU="Draft autosaved at: {time}",uU="Error loading private message.";var dU="Edit post",pU="Are you sure you want to edit this post? Editing will remove the response's recommended status.",mU="Proceed to edit";var fU="Escalate thread",gU="Are you sure you would like to escalate this thread?",hU="Thread escalated successfully";var _U="Image is no longer available.";var bU