lready have a linked account in the same organization";var ZH="Please add another account and try again.",e6=`You can only link accounts that don't have a registered profile. Please select a different account or see our <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/support/troubleshooting#user-content-account-linking">troubleshooting guidance <span class="docon docon-navigate-external" aria-hidden="true"></span></a> for more details.`;var t6="You have linked this account already",o6="{account} is a personal account. Please select a school or work account.",n6="Login account management",Jb="MCID",r6="You need at least one account linked to your profile.";var a6="Only one account per organization is supported.",i6="You can only have one personal account linked",s6="Profile is currently being merged",c6="You can refresh the page to check the merge status.",l6="Select account",cE="Please select a different account";var u6="There is already a certification profile connected to this profile",d6="In order to continue, please contact customer support to remove the current certification profile to proceed.";var p6="This profile has been locked",m6="This profile is currently locked and is being merged with another profile. Please sign-in to a different profile.",lE="Retry merge",uE="Terminate merge";var f6="Merge complete";var g6="You can refresh the page to check the merge status.",h6="Profile merge record not found",_6='Unable to find your profile merge. Please refresh the page. If the problem is still there, please contact <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/training/support/troubleshooting#report-feedback">customer support</a>.',b6="A previous merge attempt is preventing this action",x6="One of the profiles you are trying to merge is currently being merged with another profile. Please log into both profiles to check the status.";var y6="Your profiles have been successfully merged.",v6="We ran into a problem merging your source profile (username: {sourceUser}) to your destination profile (username: {destinationUser}).",T6="Some of your data might have been merged in the process, so it is expected if you find some data disappearing from your source profile and appearing on your destination profile.",w6="You can choose one of the following actions:",S6="<b>{terminateMergeText}</b>: It will stop and quit the merge process. You will be able to use both profiles as usual and can trigger a new merge at any time. The data that already merged will remain on your destination profile.",E6="<b>{retryMergeText}</b>: It will re-run the merging process for you once more. Your source profile will be locked during the merging process.",A6="Merging in progress. It may take several minutes to complete.",C6="Your merge has been terminated.";var k6="Legal name",I6="We <strong>strongly recommend you add a personal account to your Learn profile</strong> to ensure you can continue to access your learning progress regardless of your employment or academic status. You can have up to five school or work accounts and one personal account linked to your profile to use for signing in.";var R6="Congratulations! You have successfully created your profile.",P6="Enter your legal name EXACTLY as it appears on your Government Issued ID. You must take this ID to the certification exam and the proctor will check that they match. If you don't have a legal last name, please enter _ in the last name field.",Xb="First name",Zb="Last name",ex="Middle name";var L6="Microsoft MVP",D6="Microsoft Learn Student Ambassador",M6="Add Account",N6="Adjust privacy controls",O6="Before registering with this Microsoft Account, please check if you may have previously registered with a different account.",dE="Consider the following:",q6="Control Privacy",U6='If you would like to only receive emails related to the Cloud Skills Challenge please go to your <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/users/me/settings">email preferences in your Learn Profile</a> and unsubscribe after completin